url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114043514","verified_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4301580-1846651706688736","game_id":"steam-4301580","kind":"announcement","title":"🎮 Greedy - Devs & Friends Co-op Gameplay (pre-recorded)","summary":"🪙🦝 Greedy is part of Steam Next Fest! Watch the devs and some friends play the demo in online co-op. The free demo is out now, so grab your friends and give it a try! ⭐ If you enjoy it, please wishlist Greedy. It really helps a small indie team like ours. 💛 💬 Drop by and say hi Discord!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T03:46:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688736","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4301580-1846018067941443","game_id":"steam-4301580","kind":"announcement","title":"GREEDY DEMO OPEN!! 🔵","summary":"⛩️THE DUNGEON IS OPEN ⛩️ The Greedy Demo is available now on Steam.Play solo or team up with up to seven friends. Enter the ruins together, steal everything you can and try to leave with the same number of raccoons you brought in.DESCEND TO FLOOR -3 🦝🏃‍♂️‍➡️🛗Every descent reshuffles the dungeon. Rooms, optional paths, traps, enemies and rewards change between runs, forcing the team to explore and adapt. The demo includes a complete descent to Floor -3. Deeper floors, more bosses and the endless ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T15:57:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941443","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4301580-1842846814449442","game_id":"steam-4301580","kind":"announcement","title":"Greedy Playtest #3 is LIVE 🟡","summary":"Playtest 3 is open right now and closes on September 6th at 23:59 CEST. Hit Request Access on the store page and you are in. Four months since Playtest 2, and honestly it is not the same game any more. New dungeon, new enemies, new run, new reasons to keep the coins you steal. Here is what is waiting for you down there. 🏚️ A whole new dungeonFloors are built room by room now, not stitched out of corridors: bigger, better connected, and with optional rooms worth the detour. Eleven minigames with ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-05T16:57:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449442","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4301580-1831432155577327","game_id":"steam-4301580","kind":"announcement","title":"🦝 Greedy Playtest #2 Signups Are Open! 🟢","summary":"What’s new in this playtest:🧭 New tutorial and clearer onboarding⛏️ Mining minigame🎰 New roulette risk/reward system💰 Smoother coin, XP and reward feedback👹 Enemy, hideable and status-effect polish🏚️ More room variety, props, visuals and dungeon readability🌍 Localization: EN, ES (at least!)🛠️ Stability, optimization and playtest build improvements🦝 And more!🏆 Playtest Reward 🔑 Finish #1 on the leaderboard by May 10th at 23:59 CEST and you’ll get a free Steam key 💬 Join the Community: Discord 👉 P","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-04T12:58:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155577327","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4301580-1828441623106657","game_id":"steam-4301580","kind":"announcement","title":"🎮 Greedy Playtest is Live Now! 🔴","summary":"What’s new in this playtest:👹 More enemy variety and behaviours🏚️ New room events, dynamics and combat situations🧩 Find symbols in the dungeon to unlock the relic door⬆️ New upgrades and build choices🧍 Single-player and co-op endless runs🏆 Playtest Reward Finish #1 on the leaderboard by March 29th at 23.59 CET and you’ll get a free Steam key for the full game 🔑 💬 Join the Community: Discord👉 Play now, and let us know you feedback and ideas you'd like to see in the game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-28T14:19:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623106657","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:14Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4301580":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:27Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:26Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4301580":"2026-10-26T12:06:27Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4301580":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:26Z"},"5195590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:06:27Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4301580","app_id":4301580,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:33Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"5021c5352347cecaa55476bc6a6f378b932cad19a6f63622a21514d64f32ede0","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"라쿤과 함께하는 1~8인 협동 호러 익스트랙션 게임. 절차적으로 생성되는 유적에 잠입해 전부 털고 유물을 회수하세요. 탐욕의 악마 맘몬이 지켜보고 있습니다… 그의 저주를 피하세요!","publishers":[{"